{
 "component": "Switch",
 "version": 2,
 "summary": "An on/off switch: a tap flips its variable (0 or 1); the thumb springs across (a little overshoot) while the track colour fades in.",
 "params": {
  "checked": {
   "type": "variable",
   "initial": 0,
   "doc": "The 0/1 state. Bind a document variable (\"@wifi\") to read or drive it; omitted, the switch keeps its own"
  },
  "label": {
   "type": "string",
   "required": true,
   "doc": "Accessibility label (the switch draws no text)"
  },
  "color": {
   "type": "color",
   "default": "@colors.primary",
   "doc": "Track colour when on"
  }
 },
 "capabilities": [
  "input.toggle",
  "a11y.labels",
  "draw.shapes"
 ],
 "call": {
  "Switch": {
   "label": "Wi-Fi",
   "checked": "@wifi"
  }
 },
 "body": {
  "canvas": {
   "modifiers": [
    {
     "size": [
      52,
      32
     ]
    },
    {
     "semantics": {
      "contentDescription": "@label",
      "clickable": true
     }
    },
    {
     "onClick": {
      "type": "valueFloatExpressionChange",
      "target": "@checked",
      "value": "1 - @checked"
     }
    }
   ],
   "commands": [
    {
     "$if": "theme.mono",
     "then": [
      {
       "paint": {
        "ops": [
         {
          "color": "@colors.outline"
         },
         {
          "style": "stroke"
         },
         {
          "strokeWidth": "@theme.stroke"
         },
         {
          "alpha": 1
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "drawRoundRect": {
        "left": 1,
        "top": 1,
        "right": 51,
        "bottom": 31,
        "rx": 15,
        "ry": 15
       }
      },
      {
       "paint": {
        "ops": [
         {
          "color": "@color"
         },
         {
          "alpha": "@p"
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "drawRoundRect": {
        "left": 1,
        "top": 1,
        "right": 51,
        "bottom": 31,
        "rx": 15,
        "ry": 15
       }
      },
      {
       "paint": {
        "ops": [
         {
          "color": "@colors.outline"
         },
         {
          "alpha": "1 - @p"
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "drawCircle": {
        "cx": "16 + @x",
        "cy": 16,
        "radius": 8
       }
      },
      {
       "paint": {
        "ops": [
         {
          "color": "@color"
         },
         {
          "style": "fill"
         },
         {
          "alpha": "@p"
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "drawCircle": {
        "cx": "16 + @x",
        "cy": 16,
        "radius": 10
       }
      }
     ],
     "else": [
      {
       "paint": {
        "ops": [
         {
          "color": "@colors.track"
         },
         {
          "style": "fill"
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "drawRoundRect": {
        "left": 0,
        "top": 0,
        "right": 52,
        "bottom": 32,
        "rx": 16,
        "ry": 16
       }
      },
      {
       "paint": {
        "ops": [
         {
          "color": "@color"
         },
         {
          "alpha": "@p"
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "drawRoundRect": {
        "left": 0,
        "top": 0,
        "right": 52,
        "bottom": 32,
        "rx": 16,
        "ry": 16
       }
      },
      {
       "paint": {
        "ops": [
         {
          "color": "#FFFFFFFF"
         },
         {
          "alpha": 1
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "drawCircle": {
        "cx": "16 + @x",
        "cy": 16,
        "radius": 12
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 },
 "pitfalls": [
  "The motion is paint time: an animated local p = {\"value\": \"@checked\", \"anim\": 0.3} eases from 0 to 1 when the state flips (Java re-evaluates an animated expression every frame while it runs), and the thumb x is 16 + 20 * (p + 0.5 * sin(pi * p) * (2 * @checked - 1)): the sine term pushes it about 10% past the end and back, the spring feel. No layout runs while it moves",
  "The track colour follows the state without colour expressions: the `color` track is drawn over the grey one with paint alpha p",
  "Mono themes have no motion: p is @checked itself, so the thumb and the track snap (the sine term is 0 at both ends)",
  "It draws no text: put the visible label next to it (a KeyValueRow key, a ListItem title) and pass the same words as `label`"
 ],
 "locals": {
  "p": {
   "value": "@checked",
   "anim": 0.3
  },
  "x": {
   "$if": "theme.mono",
   "then": "20 * @checked",
   "else": "20 * (@p + 0.5 * sin(3.14159 * @p) * (2 * @checked - 1))"
  }
 }
}
